# Site command long description
msgid "Manage static site deployment targets with type-specific workflows.\n\nEach site has a local directory and optional configuration keys (dir, rsync, etc.).\nSite types:\n  page (default)  — Ongoing page additions, rsync from site dir directly.\n  zine            — Zine-generated site, auto-builds before rsync, rsync from public/.\n\nSubcommands:\n  list                  List all configured sites\n  add    <name> ...     Add a new site with key=value pairs\n  update <name> <k> <v> Update a site's configuration key\n  remove <name>         Remove a site\n  optimize <name>       Optimize site CSS for responsive display\n  rsync  <name>         Deploy site via rsync (auto-builds zine, optimizes CSS)\n"
msgstr "管理具有类型特定工作流的静态站点部署目标。\n\n每个站点有一个本地目录和可选配置键（dir、rsync 等）。\n站点类型：\n  page（默认）— 持续添加页面，直接从站点目录 rsync。\n  zine        — Zine 生成的站点，rsync 前自动构建，从 public/ 目录 rsync。\n\n子命令：\n  list                  列出所有已配置的站点\n  add    <name> ...     添加新站点，键=值对\n  update <name> <k> <v> 更新站点的配置键\n  remove <name>         删除站点\n  optimize <name>       优化站点 CSS 以适应响应式显示\n  rsync  <name>         通过 rsync 部署站点（自动构建 zine、优化 CSS）\n"

# Description heading
msgid "Description:"
msgstr "说明:"

# site add long description
msgid "Add a new deployment site with key-value configuration pairs.\n\nThe first positional argument is the site name. Subsequent arguments are\nkey-value pairs for site configuration.\n\nRequired keys:\n  dir   Local site directory\n\nOptional keys:\n  rsync Rsync deployment command\n  type  Site type: page (default) or zine (auto-build before rsync, public/ output)\n\nExample:\n  slingshot site add mysite dir ~/mysite rsync 'rsync -avz --delete ./ user@host:/path' type zine"
msgstr "添加新的部署站点，使用键值对配置。\n\n第一个位置参数是站点名称，后续参数是站点的键值对配置。\n\n必填键：\n  dir   本地站点目录\n\n可选键：\n  rsync Rsync 部署命令\n  type  站点类型：page（默认）或 zine（rsync 前自动构建，输出 public/）\n\n示例：\n  slingshot site add mysite dir ~/mysite rsync 'rsync -avz --delete ./ user@host:/path' type zine"

# site update long description
msgid "Update a single configuration field on an existing site.\n\nArguments:\n  <name>  Site name\n  <key>   Configuration key (e.g. dir, rsync)\n  <value> New value\n\nExample:\n  slingshot site update mysite rsync 'rsync -avz --delete ./ user@host:/path'"
msgstr "更新现有站点的单个配置字段。\n\n参数：\n  <name>  站点名称\n  <key>   配置键（如 dir、rsync）\n  <value> 新值\n\n示例：\n  slingshot site update mysite rsync 'rsync -avz --delete ./ user@host:/path'"

# site rsync long description
msgid "Run the configured rsync command to deploy site content to remote.\n\nFor zine-type sites, automatically runs 'zine build' before rsync\nand executes rsync from the 'public/' output directory.\nFor page-type sites, rsync runs directly from the site directory."
msgstr "运行已配置的 rsync 命令将站点内容部署到远程。\n\n对于 zine 类型站点，自动在 rsync 前运行 'zine build'\n并从 'public/' 输出目录执行 rsync。\n对于 page 类型站点，直接从站点目录 rsync。"

