msgid "Manage slingshot configuration file (~/.config/slingshot/config.yml).\n\nSubcommands:\n  list                  List all config keys and values\n  show                  Show full configuration\n  get    <key>          Get a config value\n  set    <key> <value>  Set a config value\n  unset <key>           Unset (delete) a config key\n"
msgstr "管理 slingshot 配置文件（~/.config/slingshot/config.yml）。\n\n子命令：\n  list                 列出所有配置键和值\n  show                 显示完整配置\n  get    <key>         获取配置值\n  set    <key> <value> 设置配置值\n  unset <key>          删除配置键\n"

msgid "Manage static site pages.\n\nEach page is a subdirectory under the site's directory containing an\nindex.html and its assets (images, etc.).\n\nSubcommands:\n  list    <site>            List all pages in a site\n  add     <site> <file>...  Add new pages from HTML/Org files\n  update  <site> <file>...  Update existing pages from HTML/Org files\n  remove  <site> <page>     Remove a page\n"
msgstr "管理静态站点页面。\n\n每个页面是站点目录下的一个子目录，包含 index.html\n及其资源文件（图片等）。\n\n子命令：\n  list    <site>            列出站点中的所有页面\n  add     <site> <file>...  从 HTML/Org 文件添加新页面\n  update  <site> <file>...  从 HTML/Org 文件更新已有页面\n  remove  <site> <page>     删除页面\n"

