msgid "Search recent traces for a service, with optional limit and tag filtering.\n\nExamples:\n  slingshot jaeger search Dscli\n  slingshot jaeger search Dscli --limit 5\n  slingshot jaeger search Dscli --tags '{\"error\":\"true\"}'"
