msgid "Initialize a new locale from en_US template"
msgstr "从 en_US 模板初始化新语言环境"

msgid "Initialize a new locale from the en_US template.\n\nCreates a new locale directory and .po file with all msgids from en_US,\nall with empty msgstr (untranslated).\n\nExample:\n  slingshot i18n add ja        # Create ja locale from en_US\n  slingshot i18n add zh_TW -d path/to/locales"
msgstr "从 en_US 模板初始化新语言环境。\n\n创建新的语言环境目录和 .po 文件，包含 en_US 中所有 msgid，\n所有 msgstr 均为空（未翻译）。\n\n示例：\n  slingshot i18n add ja        # 从 en_US 创建 ja 语言环境\n  slingshot i18n add zh_TW -d path/to/locales"

msgid "Initialize the i18n translation system in the current project.\n\nCreates the following structure:\n\n  internal/i18n/\n    i18n.go               Thin wrapper around github.com/nanjj/i18n\n    locales.go            //go:embed locales/*/*.po\n    locales/\n      en_US/<name>.po     Sentinel .po file (msgstr = msgid)\n      zh_CN/<name>.po     Starting translation file\n\nAfter running, add 'go mod tidy' to pull in the i18n dependency,\nthen use i18n.G(\"message\") in your code and run 'slingshot i18n sync'."
msgstr "在当前项目中初始化 i18n 翻译系统。\n\n创建以下结构：\n\n  internal/i18n/\n    i18n.go               github.com/nanjj/i18n 的轻量封装\n    locales.go            //go:embed locales/*/*.po\n    locales/\n      en_US/<name>.po     哨兵 .po 文件（msgstr = msgid）\n      zh_CN/<name>.po     起始翻译文件\n\n运行后，执行 go mod tidy 拉取 i18n 依赖，\n然后在代码中使用 i18n.G(\"message\") 并运行 slingshot i18n sync。"

msgid "Locale"
msgstr "语言环境"

msgid "Manage translation (.po) files"
msgstr "管理翻译（.po）文件"

msgid "Manage translation (.po) files for the slingshot i18n system.\n\nSubcommands:\n  check     Check locale consistency (missing/untranlated/orphaned entries)\n  stats     Show translation statistics per locale\n  sync      Synchronize .po files with i18n.G() calls in Go source code\n  show      Show full details of an untranslated entry by ID\n  translate Set translation for a single msgid (precise, one-at-a-time)\n  add       Initialize a new locale from en_US template\n  init      Scaffold the i18n package for a new project"
msgstr "管理 slingshot i18n 系统的翻译（.po）文件。\n\n子命令：\n  check     检查语言环境一致性（缺失/未翻译/孤立条目）\n  stats     显示各语言环境的翻译统计\n  sync      将 .po 文件与 Go 源码中的 i18n.G() 调用同步\n  show      按 ID 显示未翻译条目的完整详情\n  translate 为单个 msgid 设置翻译（精确，一对一）\n  add       从 en_US 模板初始化新语言环境\n  init      为新项目搭建 i18n 包"

msgid "Missing"
msgstr "缺失"

msgid "Missing entries:"
msgstr "缺失的条目："

